elevant part is `unsigned`, not size.","created_at":"2025-06-08T20:24:58Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T20:24:58Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2134818912","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2134818912"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2134818912"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2134818912/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":121,"original_line":121,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2134806089,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2134827285","pull_request_review_id":2908637307,"id":2134827285,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_PuEV","diff_hunk":"@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@ class Node : public Object {\n \t\tINTERNAL_MODE_BACK,\n \t};\n \n-\tenum AutoTranslateMode {\n+\tenum AutoTranslateMode : unsigned int {","path":"scene/main/node.h","commit_id":"40665addbcf4c6e306a2f5ac6fe9261e4156424f","original_commit_id":"dd345bc9217b8dbd93671d3649d85e195d7b07ec","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`int` to `unsigned int` is fine, and less risky for existing APIs than using a different size type altogether.\nIn general though it would be good to choose small data types; `uint8_t` should be plenty for most, this one included.\nCc @lawnjelly, maybe you got another take on this?","created_at":"2025-06-08T21:07:41Z","updated_at":"2025-06-08T21:08:17Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2134827285","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2134827285"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2134827285"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2134827285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":121,"original_line":121,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2134806089,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135077308","pull_request_review_id":2908990168,"id":2135077308,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_QrG8","diff_hunk":"@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@ class Node : public Object {\n \t\tINTERNAL_MODE_BACK,\n \t};\n \n-\tenum AutoTranslateMode {\n+\tenum AutoTranslateMode : unsigned int {","path":"scene/main/node.h","commit_id":"40665addbcf4c6e306a2f5ac6fe9261e4156424f","original_commit_id":"dd345bc9217b8dbd93671d3649d85e195d7b07ec","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The reason for the `unsigned` when specifying the `enum` was a compiler quirk on MSVC if I remember right, it uses signed enums by default, so we had a bug when storing 4 value enum in 2 bits, that MSVC started trying to use two's complement and reading `11` as -2 instead of 3, something like that.\r\n\r\nI'm usually a fan of using specified storage but it didn't seem to matter in that particular case, and I was only trying to force `unsigned` (and make clear the intention to other contributors, as this was new info at the time) so I didn't bother.\r\n\r\n`uint32_t` would *probably* be most sensible in retrospect. The actual bit depth is defined where used here, but the `enum` bitdepth might be used for intermediates, and `uint8_t` might (possibly?) cause some extra unnecessary checking (I really don't know, but I don't see a compelling reason to use it over `uint32_t`).\r\n\r\nSo I would personally probably still go for `uint32_t` or `unsigned int`.\r\n\r\nBut to some extent we are predicting future problems here, as long as it is `unsigned` it isn't clear there is a \"best\" version at this stage.","created_at":"2025-06-09T05:55:11Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T05:55:12Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2135077308","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135077308"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2135077308"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135077308/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":121,"original_line":121,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2134806089,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135347625","pull_request_review_id":2909441296,"id":2135347625,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_RtGp","diff_hunk":"@@ -118,7 +118,7 @@ class Node : public Object {\n \t\tINTERNAL_MODE_BACK,\n \t};\n \n-\tenum AutoTranslateMode {\n+\tenum AutoTranslateMode : unsigned int {","path":"scene/main/node.h","commit_id":"40665addbcf4c6e306a2f5ac6fe9261e4156424f","original_commit_id":"dd345bc9217b8dbd93671d3649d85e195d7b07ec","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was primarily thinking about cases where the bit packing doesn't matter, eg\n- when passed to a function\n- when stored without bit packing\n\nIn any case, this might be worth discussing in a core meeting some time. I won't block the PR over the `unsigned int` though, it's unlikely to matter _that_ much 😄","created_at":"2025-06-09T09:09:03Z","updated_at":"2025-06-09T09:09:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2135347625","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135347625"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107283#discussion_r2135347625"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107283"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2135347625/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":121,"original_line":121,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2134806089,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":5,"subject_type":"line"}]